{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04857","headline":"和尹懋秋夜游㴩湖二首 一 · 张均","name":"和尹懋秋夜游㴩湖二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远水沈西日，寒沙聚夜鸥。\n平湖乘月满，飞棹接星流。\n黄叶鸣凄吹，苍葭扫暗洲。\n愿移沧浦赏，归待颍川游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张均","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04857.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04857","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}